{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dwarf_villager","model_identifier":"dwarf_villager","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# dwarf_villager\n\nDwarf villager (A4), miner or trader, 1.3 m = 46 u.\n\nShort, very broad dwarf: wide shoulders, thick arms, big hands, barrel chest, big nose and heavy brows; long beard with a braided tail and brass beard rings. Deep-red wool shirt with rolled sleeves (bare forearms), charcoal trousers, heavy boots, and a heavy leather apron with brass studs. Carries a pick (a hammer is included as a hidden alternative). Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..46.2, z -6.0..5.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 22 x 46 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `mine` | 1.3 | loop | key 0.62 s: pick bites the rock (loop of overhead swings, 1.3 s) |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | pick resting on the right shoulder (also carried so in walk and run) |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.55 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 0.8 s (short, heavy, rolling)\n- `run`: 99.6 u/s (2.80 m/s), cycle 0.55 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `mine`: key 0.62 s: pick bites the rock (loop of overhead swings, 1.3 s)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `pick` (visible, under slot_hand_r): miner's pick, handle 31 u, head 11 u tall, grip at the origin 4 u from the butt\n- `hammer` (hidden, under slot_hand_r): smith's / trader's hammer alternative\n- `beard` (group under head): hide it for beardless female dwarves\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- pick (mine): second grip (left hand) 9 u along the handle forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_villager_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_villager_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_villager_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_villager_grey.png`: grey (old) beard\n- `dwarf_villager_female.png`: female dwarf colours (braided hair; hide the `beard` group or keep it as a short beard)\n"},"description":"# dwarf_villager\n\nDwarf villager (A4), miner or trader, 1.3 m = 46 u.\n\nShort, very broad dwarf: wide shoulders, thick arms, big hands, barrel chest, big nose and heavy brows; long beard with a braided tail and brass beard rings. Deep-red wool shirt with rolled sleeves (bare forearms), charcoal trousers, heavy boots, and a heavy leather apron with brass studs. Carries a pick (a hammer is included as a hidden alternative). Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..46.2, z -6.0..5.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 22 x 46 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `mine` | 1.3 | loop | key 0.62 s: pick bites the rock (loop of overhead swings, 1.3 s) |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | pick resting on the right shoulder (also carried so in walk and run) |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.55 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 0.8 s (short, heavy, rolling)\n- `run`: 99.6 u/s (2.80 m/s), cycle 0.55 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `mine`: key 0.62 s: pick bites the rock (loop of overhead swings, 1.3 s)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `pick` (visible, under slot_hand_r): miner's pick, handle 31 u, head 11 u tall, grip at the origin 4 u from the butt\n- `hammer` (hidden, under slot_hand_r): smith's / trader's hammer alternative\n- `beard` (group under head): hide it for beardless female dwarves\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- pick (mine): second grip (left hand) 9 u along the handle forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_villager_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_villager_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_villager_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_villager_grey.png`: grey (old) beard\n- `dwarf_villager_female.png`: female dwarf colours (braided hair; hide the `beard` group or keep it as a short beard)\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,21.0,-4.5],"to":[7.0,24.0,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"infla